@startuml
title Expense Lifecycle (required states; proposed transitions)
[*] --> PENDING_REVIEW : submit valid expense
PENDING_REVIEW --> PENDING_REVIEW : approval recorded; more required
PENDING_REVIEW --> APPROVED : final required approval / post ledger atomically
PENDING_REVIEW --> REJECTED : authorized rejection
APPROVED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
note right of PENDING_REVIEW
No balance or ledger effect while pending.
Duplicate decisions/postings are prevented.
end note
note right of REJECTED
No financial effect.
end note
@enduml
